PhiR = c0 + c1 r cos(theta): only l = 0, 1 are nonzero. imAR = {Im phiR(aR), \
Im phiR'(aR)}, which the notebook discards with Re[valR].\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c45f74bc-f591-4537-89d7-8ff081fd8e5c"],

