Full tables and 3D reconstruction: run stage3b_second_order_solve.wls \
(results/stage3_*). The Grad.Grad (1/rho^4) case, Q = \"GradDot\", is \
implemented with the same functions (regular-field inputs are pairs {phi, \
dphi/dr}); see stage5a/stage5b.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"41732f5c-4e9c-4904-9658-9b67b8216615"]
